 result←object New arg;parent;name;actions;props;newobj;∆border;∆style;stretch;extent
 (parent name)←object ⍝ Separate non-standard two-part argument
 actions←⊃¨⊆¨arg ⍝ The names of the actions that they've asked to create this object with

 (∆border ∆style)←((1↓¨arg),⊂⍬)[actions⍳'border' 'style']
 ∆border←0⌈×+/∊∆border ⋄ ∆style←##._supp.SetBitVals ∆style
 extent←(1+1∊∆style)⊃_supp.(_extentV _extentH) ⍝ Allow different default sizing based on orientation
 stretch←(1+1∊∆style)⊃(0 1)(1 0)
 arg←(parent:parent ⋄ stretch:stretch ⋄ border:∆border ⋄ extent:extent)##.##.New.Center arg

 props←'UpDown'('Visible' 0) ⍝ Properties that should be used during creation
 props,←⊂'VScroll'(-~1∊∆style) ⍝? Create-only
 props,←⊂'HScroll'(-1∊∆style) ⍝? Create-only
 props,←⊂'Border'∆border ⍝ Set border upon creation ⍝? Create-only
 props,←⊂'Wrap' 0 ⍝ APL+Win has a different default
 newobj←⎕VGET(parent⍕⍛,'.',name)##.##.∆WC props ⍝ Create the actual Dyalog object
 result←parent newobj ##.##.New.Initialize arg ⍝ Complete standard class-initialization procedure
